ed-bsp-config (1.0.2) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Display serial numbers from scanned ordering codes.
  * Provide Chinese and English versions of the repository documentation.
  * Use SX1302 for GWL models and select the band from the ordering code.
    Reject conflicting packages and region overrides, and apply the GWL2110
    I2C, SPI, and reset settings.

 -- zjzhao <zjzhao@edatec.cn>  Thu, 19 Nov 2026 11:29:25 +0800

ed-bsp-config (1.0.1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Add ed-config-order for ordering codes and scanner input. It selects tool
    packages by default and supports explicit unattended confirmation with -y.
  * Bundle the pinned ed-sn-analysis parser and ordering table in the DEB.
    Initialize the parser submodule on demand from a source checkout.
  * Add HMI2002_116C with ed-ddcci-mib-tool and HMI3320_156C/HMI3321_156C
    with the corresponding SBC configuration.
  * Map CM0NANO ordering codes to IPC1000 and CM4MED10 codes to CM4MEDIA.
  * Document adding a model and using the ordering code entry point.

 -- zjzhao <zjzhao@edatec.cn>  Wed, 18 Nov 2026 18:30:26 +0800

